1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,820
 Here's a life-changing hack to prevent sibling rivalry and jealousy, it's called don't blame the baby

2
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:12,320
 How often have we all said things like no, I can't play with you right now. I'm feeding the baby

3
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:17,920
 Charlie be quiet. The baby is sleeping. No, we are not going the playground right now

4
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:24,040
 Your sister is too fussy now think about this from your toddler's perspective ever since this little tiny thing

5
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:28,560
 That's crying all the time came into their lives all of a sudden

6
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,480
 They can't be loud

7
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:36,400
 Mommy doesn't play with me as much anymore and I can't go to the park all of a sudden life is not very fun

8
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,880
 And you want to know why?

9
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:45,400
 It's because of my baby brother or sister instead say the exact same things. You can still say no just don't blame the baby

10
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:51,120
 Yes, I would love to play with you. I need six minutes and then I will play with you

11
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:57,200
 We can't go to the park right now, but we can go to the park after nap time today. Okay?

